  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "日文習作(一)",
    "sub_ename": "JAPANESE WRITING I",
    "describe_ch": "該課程針對具有中?或以上日語水準的學生，涉及為現實生活中的使用情況撰寫短文。 不僅強調語法的正確性，而且還強調句子的內容和結構以及人際關係的維護和發展。",
    "describe_eh": "This class is designed for students with intermediate Japanese language level or above and will involve writing short sentences for real-life usage situations. Emphasis will be placed not only on correct grammar, but also on the content and structure of the sentences, as well as on the maintenance and development of human relationships.",
